      propertyPath: title
      value: Tank types!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3069120216388199022, guid: a5dff51da41e8474980de5173f8b8723,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: message
      value: "There are several types of tanks you will face during your matches.
        \nYou can see them displayed here. \nEach tank has it's own strenghts and
        weaknesses.\n\nYou are currently a Light Tank, the smallest of the bunch,
        this means you have less health and deal less damage per shot compared to
        other tanks, but you make up for it in speed! \n\nYou will get to explore
        the other tanks after you have finished the tutorial.\n\nWhen you are ready,
        head to the next point so we can do some shooting!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
