      propertyPath: title
      value: Shooting!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3069120216388199022, guid: a5dff51da41e8474980de5173f8b8723,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: message
      value: "Alright, I will take over the driving from here, I have switched your
        role to the Observer.\n\nYou can turn our turret by using your A/D keys and
        the barrel up and down by using W/S keys. \n\nWhen you have you turret alligned
        with a target, just say the word (by pressing Q) and I will fire! If we miss,
        just reload the gun by pressing R. \n\nYou wont have the Q button when the
        real fighting starts, so communicating with your driver is essential!\n\nOnce
        we have taken out these stationary targets, we will move on to something
        more challenging."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5262733661499909651, guid: a5dff51da41e8474980de5173f8b8723,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Layer
