      propertyPath: message
      value: 'As you might have noticed, all this driving around drains the battery
        of your tank, keep an eye on the battery tracker in the top right corner
        of your Heads up display.


        If your battery is depleted your driving
        speed (and reloading time) will become much slower.


        New batteries
        to recharge your tank can be found throughout the level, try to find them
        before you battery gets depleted.'
